4
00:00:17,119 --> 00:00:22,158
nor valiant, taking perils as they came with an indifferent heir, and while

5
00:00:22,159 --> 00:00:26,399
engaged in the most imminent crisis of the chase, toiling away calm and

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:30,956
collected as a journeyman joiner, engaged for the year. Good humored,

7
00:00:30,957 --> 00:00:35,359
easy, and careless, he presided over his whaleboat, as if the most deadly

8
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:40,399
encounter were but a dinner, and his crew all invited guests. He was as

9
