20
00:01:35,919 --> 00:01:41,199
What perhaps with other things made Stubs such an easygoing, unfearing man,

21
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:45,598
so cheerfully trudging off with the burden of life in a world full of grave

22
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:50,478
